# Results are COMMITTED, not ignored. Full regeneration takes over an hour, so a
# reader must be able to redraw every figure from the payloads in seconds.
#
# Figures are committed too: the spec asks for vector output and the manuscripts
# cite this repository by URL.

# The paper is not redistributed here -- follow the DOI.
2026FuToliasFranke_facilitation.pdf

# Local working notes, deliberately NOT shipped: the number registry and manuscript
# queue (PRINTED_OUTPUTS.md) and the working instructions (CLAUDE.md). Everything a
# reader needs is in the code, the tests, README.md, NUMBERS.md and DEVIATIONS.md.
# The release is a single commit taken from the working tree, so these lines keep
# the notes out of it.
PRINTED_OUTPUTS.md
CLAUDE.md
